Package: agrisvm
Title: Support Vector Machine Classification of Crop Health and Stress
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Lunganlung", "P. G.", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "lunganlungpg@gmail.com")
Description: Classifies crop condition (healthy, nutrient deficiency or fungal
    blight) from spectral and phenomic indicators
    (NDVI, NDRE, canopy temperature, SPAD chlorophyll, leaf moisture) with
    radial-kernel support vector machines, and reports confusion matrices and
    held-out accuracy. Ships helpers to load the sample phenomics dataset used
    in the accompanying Python pipeline.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/agri-svm-classification
BugReports: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/agri-svm-classification/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    e1071,
    stats,
    utils
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
